# ==============================================================================
# 自用代理规则源 (Source Ruleset)
# 说明: 直接写纯域名即可（自动判断为域名后缀）；关键词写 keyword:xxx 或直接写词；精准域名写 exact:xxx
# ==============================================================================

# for myself
host-suffix, bitwarden.com, proxy
host-suffix, pythonhosted.org, proxy

# hysteria
host-keyword, hysteria, proxy

# pocketcasts
host-suffix, pocketcasts.com, proxy
host-suffix, pca.st, proxy

